  "title": "Southern Broccoli and Cauliflower Salad",
  "description": "This delicious Southern-inspired broccoli and cauliflower salad with a super creamy dressing, sweet raisins, crunchy almonds, and savory bacon is perfect for a potluck.",
  "authors": [
    "Bob Butler"
